00:01:09.517 --> 00:01:25.620
<v Ananya Desai>Okay so, left to right. Sources: Slack, Gmail, WhatsApp exports, CRM, and meeting transcripts. All of them come in through Nango for the OAuth stuff, except WhatsApp, which is just file upload for now because there's no real API for personal chats.</v>

13
