00:02:34.137 --> 00:02:37.573
<v Rohan Kulkarni>Okay. And the app itself is Next.js on Vercel?</v>

22
00:02:38.468 --> 00:02:50.433
<v Ananya Desai>Next.js on Vercel, Drizzle for the schema and migrations, and the model calls go through the AI SDK with the Vercel AI Gateway, so we can switch providers without rewriting stuff.</v>

23
00:02:50.874 --> 00:02:57.364
